model bounded_counter "A single counter that should reach 3 (with weak fairness)"
description "The smallest liveness example. One process increments a counter to 3. Weak fairness says an action that stays enabled is eventually taken, so the count must reach 3."

var count : 0..3 = 0

process Counter {
  action tick when count < 3 { count := count + 1 }
}

terminal count = 3

invariant InRange: count >= 0 and count <= 3
liveness ReachesThree: eventually count = 3

fairness weak Counter
